               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>I RAN OUT OF VAPE JUICE AND HAD TO RUN TO THE SMOKE SHOP. I ALS</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>I RAN OUT OF VAPE JUICE AND HAD TO RUN TO THE SMOKE SHOP. I ALSO FORGOT THAT I DONT HAVE ANY MORE ZYNS, SO I GOT MORE OF THOSE! SHOULD I PICK-UP ANYTHING ELSE?</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>I DONT THINK THAT MY TEXT LOOKS THAT GOOD SMALL BUT WHO KNOWS M</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>I DONT THINK THAT MY TEXT LOOKS THAT GOOD SMALL BUT WHO KNOWS MAYBE IT DOES. IF I AM TALKING TO MYSELF IS ANYONE INCLUDING MYSELF LISTENING? pROBABLY NOT, BUT ILL RAMBLE ON ANYWAYS. ITS AN EMPTY VOID ANYWAYS BUT PLANTING NATIVE WILDFLOWERS IS REALLY SATISFYING ON THE SOULD. YOU SHOULD HAVE A GARDEN AND GROW YOURE OWN FOOD. MIGHT SAVE YOU LATER. HELP YOUR FELLOW NEIGHBOR AND RESPECT THE STICKERS THAT I PUT UP. PLEASE DONT TEAR THOSE DOWN.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
